    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of one main landing gear brake position, showing the brake filter, the accumulator kit, the torque tube hardware and the wear and temperature sensing items.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of one main landing gear brake position, including the hydraulic interface and the wear and temperature sensing items. Use it to order brake hardware and sensing parts.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows one brake position; the aircraft carries sixteen main wheel positions and the breakdown repeats at each. The swaged collars at the torque tube interface are single use and are always ordered with a brake change. The wear pin scale differs between heat stack standards and is not a catalogue item; refer to the applicable maintenance task for the reading procedure."
    },
